  "id": "pas",
  "term": "PAS",
  "definition": "PAS stands for Premorbid Adjustment Scale, a retrospective 26-item questionnaire used to rate how well a person met developmental and social milestones from childhood to adulthood before schizophrenia began. It assesses areas such as sociability, relationships, school functioning, and socio-sexual development, with higher scores reflecting poorer adjustment.",
